  "goodToKnow": "Das Lösungsmittel is a solvent, a liquid that dissolves other substances: Wasser ist das wichtigste Lösungsmittel; acetone and turpentine are others. Paints and glues are often labelled lösungsmittelfrei (solvent-free) for health reasons. Lösen means to dissolve and also to solve: ein Problem lösen, and die Lösung is both solution senses. The plural is the same."
